  "question": {
    "text": "<p>By what percentage will the transmission range of a TV tower be affected when the height of the tower is increased by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math>?</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The range of a TV tower antenna is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>New height is given as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>21</mn><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p><p>Let the new range be</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>R</mi></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>21</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;So, the increase in the range is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
